          "filename": "North Portal of Passage Tunnel, Passage West, Co Cork - geograph.org.uk - 76749.jpg",
          "caption": "North Portal of Passage Tunnel, Passage West, Co Cork. The trail following the Cork, Blackrock &amp; Passage Railway ends at Passage West but the railway, after passing through the 535 yds Passage Tunnel, continued a further ten miles to Crosshaven at the entrance to Cork Harbour. This is the sealed north portal of the tunnel.",
          "alt": "North Portal of Passage Tunnel, Passage West, Co Cork. The trail following the Cork, Blackrock &amp; Passage Railway ends at Passage West but the railway, after passing through the 535 yds Passage Tunnel, continued a further ten miles to Crosshaven at the entrance to Cork Harbour. This is the sealed north portal of the tunnel.",
