          "filename": "South Portal of Passage Tunnel, Glenbook, Co Cork - geograph.org.uk - 76751.jpg",
          "caption": "South Portal of Passage Tunnel, Glenbook, Co Cork. This is the south portal of Passage Tunnel on the Cork, Blackrock &amp; Passage Railway at Glenbrook. From here the line headed south west to Carrigaline where it turned east to follow the south bank of the Owen River to the Crosshaven terminus. The four miles between Carrigaline and Crosshaven is now a riverside walk.",
          "alt": "South Portal of Passage Tunnel, Glenbook, Co Cork. This is the south portal of Passage Tunnel on the Cork, Blackrock &amp; Passage Railway at Glenbrook. From here the line headed south west to Carrigaline where it turned east to follow the south bank of the Owen River to the Crosshaven terminus. The four miles between Carrigaline and Crosshaven is now a riverside walk.",
